.coverage

# local disk corpus cache written by utils/deep_analysis.py
data/cache/

# per-run report from scripts/backfill_price_history.py. A record of one
# machine's run -- which days it wrote, which were closed, which failed -- not
# a description of the repository.
backfill_summary.json

# Landing-page design mockups (~18 MB of PNG variants a/b/b3/b4/b5, decision
# workspace v2-v4). Working exploration, superseded by whatever shipped, and
# referenced by no code or document. Git keeps every blob forever and this repo
# is public, so committing them would weigh down every future clone for images
# nothing links to. Keep them locally or move them outside the repository.
docs/home/
docs/home_landing/
docs/landing-page-decision-workspace-*.png
